	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "WS2812C-2427-V6 addressable RGB LED, 2.70 x 2.40 x 1.10 mm, 4 pads. The datasheet (V1.0 p.2) gives no land pattern: lands derived from its bottom-view terminals (0.75 x 0.40 mm, 1.20 mm apart across, 1.30 mm pitch along) with 0.10 mm toe (bottom-only terminals; it keeps the courtyard clear of D5 and C18 on the main board), 0.05 mm heel and 0.05 mm side extensions. 3D body: the LCSC/EasyEDA model of the WS2812C-2427 (C4154872), checked against p.2.")
